@startuml add student to class
title Teacher Add Student To Class — Sequence Diagram

actor Teacher <<actor>>
boundary "ManageClassPage" as UI <<boundary>>
control "ClassController" as Controller <<control>>
control "ClassService" as Service <<control>>
control "ClassRepository" as Repository <<control>>
entity "Class" as ClassModel <<entity>>
database "MySQL" as DB <<entity>>

Teacher -> UI: Update class settings
UI -> Controller: PUT /classes/{id}
Controller -> Controller: validate(payload)
alt validation fails
	Controller --> UI: 422 ValidationErrors
else
	Controller -> Service: updateClass(id, payload)
	Service -> Repository: update(id, payload)
	Repository -> DB: UPDATE class
	ClassModel --> Repository: OK
	Repository --> Service: updatedClass
	Service --> Controller: 200 OK
	Controller --> UI: confirmation
end

@enduml